","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922020232_2c03f325","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:9f1ae97a0292357d497c6784","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_3edc6ed0268a0557\n章节编号=6.5\n章节标题=研究治疗依从性\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"cffc86387e26b123b16fddf2bb5111f83fdb540d4a3ceec9ece76068e1e74874","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:9f1ae97a0292357d497c6784","span_id":"span_sec_6_5"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"剂量与给药方案：合成试验药A：100 mg，每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性\n匹配安慰剂：每日一次（QD）（口服）；第1天至第16周双盲治疗期。依从：通过药品计数及受试者日记评价依从性","quote_sha256":"94fb65afc774da062ed601e6f161a821a0ac0ae3a448c3184db20ac0caba0782","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_study_dose_adherence"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","quote":"访视策略：筛选后于基线/第1天随机；第2、4、8、12、16周进行治疗期访视，第20周进行安全性随访。PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价。","quote_sha256":"8c7a570d51b842be51c8689066b3d6fe50030b8229d96708644c920d085e82c5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","span_id":"span_study_visits"}],"evidence_span_ids":["span_sec_6_5","span_study_dose_adherence","span_study_visits"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"heading":"研究治疗依从性","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本章节描述双盲治疗期内研究治疗依从性的评价方式。试验组受试者接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服，每日一次，对照组受试者接受匹配安慰剂，给药持续至第16周。研究治疗依从性通过药品计数及受试者日记进行评价，评价覆盖自第1天至第16周的双盲治疗期。治疗期访视安排于第2、4、8、12、16周。药品计数与受试者日记记录用于反映受试者实际服药情况与方案给药要求的一致性。","rationale":"已确认事实支持：试验组接受合成试验药A 100 mg口服每日一次，对照组接受匹配安慰剂，双盲治疗期16周；两组依从性均通过药品计数及受试者日记评价。医学作者需核对依从性合格阈值、未达标的处理方式及缺失记录处理规则，这些内容在现有来源中未明确。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_3edc6ed0268a0557","section_number":"6.5","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9f1ae97a0292357d497c6784","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922020232_2c03f325","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"合并用药/治疗","missing_source_classes":["合并用药/治疗允许与禁止规则的方案设计决策记录","研究者手册或试验药A的相互作用与安全性数据","救援治疗定义的方案设计决策记录"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"已确认事实提及停药或使用救援治疗按复合策略判定为无应答，但未提供合并用药允许与禁止规则、救援治疗定义、洗脱期或药物相互作用管理要求。医学作者需核对研究者手册、既往研究数据及项目决策记录，确认本章节应覆盖的具体规则。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_f2862d79759a5299","section_number":"6.6","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:9f1ae97a0292357d497c6784","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:9f1ae97a0292357d497c6784","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:9f1ae97a0292357d497c6784","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"e800064dc1ffdae25304180895952d64bb2b88c2233db9c95a9842d184fedb1c"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","text_sha256":"787313a6f081b1c9afdf03800feb1c50c317aa4aa4f0c3884e924b0594e666da"}]}